            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.109</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Seedance reference videos.</b> Registering a reference video as a person no longer fails with a frame rate error. Videos with an unsupported frame rate now get a clear hint.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
