            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.108</h2>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">Nano Banana 2.1</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Thinking level, web search and seed.</b> Choose how much the model reasons, ground images in current web results, and reuse a seed for repeatable results.</li>
<li><b>Context limits for Nano Banana 2.1 Edit.</b> PDFs up to 20 pages, videos up to 30 s and audio up to 60 s.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:8px 0 4px">Prompt editor</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Syntax colors on demand.</b> Switch them on with the highlighter button below the editor. Window &gt; Syntax Legend explains each color.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
